    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IBA‑approved consignment bilty</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Issued by the Indian Bureau of Shipping (IBA) or an authorized shipping line, this bilty records the vehicle’s details, the shipper’s and consignee’s information, and the agreed terms of carriage. It is the legal contract that binds the carrier to the shipment.</p>
